      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("What is this place? That is one big mountain!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("That is the fabled Gryphon Mountain."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Gryphon Mountain! Maybe we could steal some eggs from the gryphons and train the young to be flying mounts. Would that work, Delfador?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We can try to do that, but we must be careful. To disturb the gryphons could prove dangerous... and yet such mounts could help us greatly later. Whatever we do, we must pass by this place."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Well, let’s start climbing the mountain!"),
          },
        ],
