                tree: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22and%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22gryphon_disposition%22%2C%22greater_than_equal_to%22%3A%222%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22have_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%223%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("It is a shame we could not get those gryphon eggs. I am glad we did not slaughter any gryphons. They are magnificent animals (looks back at the mountain). Still..."),
